rect "q-316617/field-3/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8" :answer-field/choices ["q-316617/field-3/a4c8bdda186d0d425e9963bf17967cd5e356d934f319fa58135b8f8cf8a589f8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316617/field-4/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer/id #uuid "0e68c843-f27c-5e49-9298-c55dab376cf3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-316617/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "c8078909-afdc-5bb3-ac92-eb797b3038df" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-316617/field-4/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer-field/choices ["q-316617/field-4/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-316617" :question/id #uuid "ef6eba9d-6395-5176-8a97-4f77fe2fd73d" :question/math-academy-id "q-316617" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-4,$ ${x}_{2}=1,$ and ${x}_{3}=2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $3.$ Find $P(x).$\n\n$P(x)=$\n{{field-1}}${x}^{3}\\,+$\n{{field-2}}${x}^{2}\\,-$\n{{field-3}}$x\\,+$\n{{field-4}}" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-4,$ ${x}_{2}=1,$ and ${x}_{3}=2,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=3,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =3(x-(-4))(x-1)(x-2) \\\\  & =3(x+4)(x-1)(x-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(x+4)(x-1)(x-2) & =3({x}^{2}+3x-4)(x-2) \\\\  & =3({x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+3{x}^{2}-6x-4x+8) \\\\  & =3({x}^{3}+{x}^{2}-10x+8) \\\\  & =3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-30x+24.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}-30x+24.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-316617/field-1" "q-316617/field-2" "q-316617/field-3" "q-316617/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-316617"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681/selection/2f8c0f688cadbf347b9e7740ffe633dee602dc0148075fb393a00b2757bee8f7" :answer/id #uuid "bd7b13fb-b445-5fe2-bff8-ad254883cc83" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+8x+9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681/selection/de42dda45789abc8fa15f9c8a4484b926008bc4882af3623d25ce81efd82461e" :answer/id #uuid "bd93bce9-90d4-5262-84cc-f961bf702490" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}+8{x}^{2}+11x+10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681/selection/56b8bda3a87a56e745be365aa05177d6eea5e4a425aaf1efe3da6e20fafc55f1" :answer/id #uuid "3dc5df4b-1d30-5a54-b5a2-e23d08ba0010" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+x+20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681/selection/31ebc512d7ccf0305970b5af50d6624b7e3baa0cf203044f7c6a2f6e43b888b2" :answer/id #uuid "86941038-ebe7-5c3e-af46-5e8d3a2057c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+5x+10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681/selection/80db934a679cd70da6ed13700f76c71fa317d814b77ab9901bc589589e0c266f" :answer/id #uuid "d43578ed-8490-57e6-ae17-c39bbd98e882" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+11x+20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "955d8a49-776c-576a-a999-54912f95df8f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-107681/selection/80db934a679cd70da6ed13700f76c71fa317d814b77ab9901bc589589e0c266f" :answer-field/choices ["q-107681/selection/2f8c0f688cadbf347b9e7740ffe633dee602dc0148075fb393a00b2757bee8f7" "q-107681/selection/de42dda45789abc8fa15f9c8a4484b926008bc4882af3623d25ce81efd82461e" "q-107681/selection/56b8bda3a87a56e745be365aa05177d6eea5e4a425aaf1efe3da6e20fafc55f1" "q-107681/selection/31ebc512d7ccf0305970b5af50d6624b7e3baa0cf203044f7c6a2f6e43b888b2" "q-107681/selection/80db934a679cd70da6ed13700f76c71fa317d814b77ab9901bc589589e0c266f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107681" :question/id #uuid "8b622ddf-d8be-54e3-8391-21ca3422a7bf" :question/math-academy-id "q-107681" :question/problem "The cubic polynomial $P(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=-1,$ ${x}_{2}=4,$ and ${x}_{3}=5,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $1.$ Find $P(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Since our cubic polynomial has roots ${x}_{1}=-1,$ ${x}_{1}=4,$ and ${x}_{3}=5,$ and the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=1,$ we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) & =1(x-(-1))(x-4)(x-5) \\\\  & =(x+1)(x-4)(x-5)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+1)(x-4)(x-5) & =({x}^{2}-3x-4)(x-5) \\\\  & ={x}^{3}-3{x}^{2}-5{x}^{2}+15x-4x+20 \\\\  & ={x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+11x+20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)={x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+11x+20.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-107681/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107681"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-104467/selection/190605a4561e82e279ad8df110e882780614c6f0f7886dd70bdc5d03af7662aa" :answer/id #uuid "f7d017c2-e3ff-56d9-9334-9ac4fa843657" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-{x}^{3}+4{x}^{2}-19x+30" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104467/selection/8c368d0396d7e443d71747fd024edb013b8df959fea7174ecbe0b0240e167294" :answer/id #uuid "151c154c-d125-5381-9ace-152bee787a80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}+12{x}^{2}+47x+60" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-104467/selection/c12a4e579ab9a8c10d9d936b25834aab9158ddd49c2fb0cde3308b3b55dd0027" :answer/id #uuid "e58c95f7-87e5-56a0-956d-88829d4e8f33" :answer/type