, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-(x+5)(x+4)(x+3) & =-({x}^{2}+9x+20)(x+3) \\\\  & =-({x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+9{x}^{2}+27x+20x+60) \\\\  & =-{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}-47x-60.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $P(x)=-{x}^{3}-12{x}^{2}-47x-60.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-104467/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "517f2054-008e-54eb-89dd-5f0a09e1f881"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104467"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670/selection/51af9eeea7c4ab62ecd2dc0a03d879e1717ae0f309cf69afc6be49852f0fbe34" :answer/id #uuid "21b6a9b3-baef-5315-b1b9-da739f1d1a46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670/selection/0d4c15299c779098087f78bf288eff4a84a1fbda214c49efbb138bae60daad87" :answer/id #uuid "af094840-468d-54c0-b013-c15534112a19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{3}-8{x}^{2}+16x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670/selection/42ac72a9c3b651615d4c3a6bcc7020b0fd11942131405e3461d26569a6bee94b" :answer/id #uuid "240e3f0e-d70e-5a16-8c55-f76e7e83e4d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+10x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670/selection/d4a401b05a7738d0712661959c3cad5e308b4286bf83c835c5ff6ee46d28f91e" :answer/id #uuid "01cd5c5a-cd6b-5097-b524-14a8b4624aa9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}+32x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670/selection/fb5b4c3cc61b12c28275b32dd78f966ba324a56a98b3851451a29094830c0756" :answer/id #uuid "1207e264-c672-5dcb-bfe4-eaa0a7ca73bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{x}^{3}-4{x}^{2}+8x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7d86a62f-bd17-5303-ba04-3f9325c1e31c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-107670/selection/d4a401b05a7738d0712661959c3cad5e308b4286bf83c835c5ff6ee46d28f91e" :answer-field/choices ["q-107670/selection/51af9eeea7c4ab62ecd2dc0a03d879e1717ae0f309cf69afc6be49852f0fbe34" "q-107670/selection/0d4c15299c779098087f78bf288eff4a84a1fbda214c49efbb138bae60daad87" "q-107670/selection/42ac72a9c3b651615d4c3a6bcc7020b0fd11942131405e3461d26569a6bee94b" "q-107670/selection/d4a401b05a7738d0712661959c3cad5e308b4286bf83c835c5ff6ee46d28f91e" "q-107670/selection/fb5b4c3cc61b12c28275b32dd78f966ba324a56a98b3851451a29094830c0756"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-107670" :question/id #uuid "78253fad-7e11-5fbb-92d7-9defd14f1c64" :question/math-academy-id "q-107670" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14039932/assets/a926400e24bc00ca9027d44461e800fa22015ff8289f05fba3a8b51f8b72cce5.png)\n\nThe Argand diagram above shows the roots of the cubic polynomial $f(x).$ Find $f(x)$ given that the coefficient of the cubic term is $4.$" :question/worked-solution "From the diagram, we see that $f(x)$ has roots ${x}_{1}=0$ and ${x}_{2,3}=2\\pm 2\\text{i}.$ Additionally, we're given that the coefficient of the cubic term is $a=4.$ Therefore, we can write the polynomial as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =a(x-{x}_{1})(x-{x}_{2})(x-{x}_{3}) \\\\  & =4(x-0)(x-(2+2\\text{i}))(x-(2-2\\text{i})) \\\\  & =4x(x-(2+2\\text{i}))(x-(2-2\\text{i}))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nExpanding the parentheses, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x(x-(2+2\\text{i}))(x-(2-2\\text{i})) & = \\\\ 4x({x}^{2}-x(2-2\\text{i})-x(2+2\\text{i})+(2+2\\text{i})(2-2\\text{i})) & = \\\\ 4x({x}^{2}-4x+8) & = \\\\ 4{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}+32x & .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $f(x)=4{x}^{3}-16{x}^{2}+32x.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-107670/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e4bb90c5-2794-5657-8f0b-45eb64873e03"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-107670"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}